## Model card

- **Name:** Omi Alpha (omi-alpha)
- **Short description:** **NOT AN AI LLM MODEL.** Search reveals three unrelated entities: (1) **BasedHardware Omi** — wearable AI device with long-term memory benchmarks (LoCoMo 86.6%, LongMemEval 83.3%, BEAM) on GitHub (BasedHardware/omi-memory-benchmarks). (2) **Omi Health** — medical speech-to-text APIs (M-WER 0.87%, drug-term error 0.23%, dosage match 93.62%). (3) **OMI Alpha** — WWII Italian electromechanical cipher machine (cryptomuseum.com). No LLM model card, no model ID, no parameter count, no architecture.
- **Provider / access:** BasedHardware (wearable), Omi Health (medical STT API). Not an LLM model provider.
- **Release / knowledge:** Omi wearable: 2024–2026. Omi Health: 2025–2026. OMI Alpha cipher: ~1939. No LLM release.
- **IDs:** No LLM model ID. GitHub: BasedHardware/omi-memory-benchmarks, Omi-Health/medical-STT-eval.
- **Context window:** N/A (not an LLM).
- **Modalities:** Omi wearable: audio/text (memory). Omi Health: audio (medical STT). Not LLM modalities.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-27):** Omi wearable: hardware device. Omi Health: API pricing (vs Google/AssemblyAI/Deepgram/etc.). Not LLM pricing.
- **Architecture:** Omi wearable: memory system (LoCoMo eval). Omi Health: STT model (omi-med-stt-v1, 0.6B/3B). Not LLM architecture.

